  "schema:description": "This data set contains ROV Tiburon navigation system documentation from the R/V Thomas G. Thompson expedition TN172 conducted in 2004 (Chief Scientist: Dr. John Delaney; Investigators: Dr. John Delaney, Dr. Alden Denny, and Dr. Deborah Kelley). These data files are of PDF format. Funding was provided by NSF grant: OCE04-00471.",
